    <string name="core_session_body">Tap Start and choose «Entire screen» (or «Share screen») so the agent can see what you see.</string>
    <string name="core_notifications_body">Allow notifications: Bekon shows the session status and the agent\'s requests there.</string>
    <string name="core_restricted_body">Android blocks Accessibility for apps installed outside Google Play.\n1. Tap «Open App info».\n2. Tap ⋮ (top right) → «Allow restricted settings» → confirm.\n3. Come back here.\nNo ⋮ menu? First try step «Bekon Gestures» once, see «Restricted setting», then return.</string>
    <string name="core_a11y_body">So the agent can point at buttons and help you tap.\n1. Tap «Open settings».\n2. Find %1$s → «Bekon Gestures».\n3. Turn it ON and confirm «Allow».\n4. Come back here (Back button).</string>
